Files in this directory are vendored verbatim from:

  https://github.com/mclwu22/BrainDINO/tree/main/BrainDINO_seg/dinov3

The upstream copyright header is preserved on each file:

  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
  This software may be used and distributed in accordance with
  the terms of the DINOv3 License Agreement.

The only modifications are:
  1. Absolute imports `from dinov3.layers import X` rewritten as
     package-relative `from .layers import X` so the vendored copy is
     self-contained.
  2. `fp8_linear.py` was not vendored (we do not use FP8 inference);
     `layers/__init__.py` exposes a no-op `convert_linears_to_fp8`
     stub in its place.

Refer to the DINOv3 License Agreement for use terms (the upstream repo
does not contain a LICENSE file; consult Meta's DINOv3 release for the
full text):

  https://ai.meta.com/dinov3/
